      "edition": "Thursday 15 October",
      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Coaching churn",
          "heading": "Jake White becomes Fiji's third head coach after Mick Byrne's removal",
          "body": "Planet Rugby's analysis of Jake White's appointment starts with a count: he is Fiji's third head coach this year. Mick Byrne, the former head coach, said Fiji wanted to 'move in a new direction', and the union chairman first cited health issues before saying he had been removed. Interim coach Senirusi Seruvakula oversaw defeats to Wales, England and Scotland before the job went to White, whom Planet Rugby calls a gamble."
        },
        {
          "kicker": "Around the world",
          "heading": "Wallabies' Nawaqanitawase out of UK Nations Championship Tests",
          "body": "All Blacks call in replacements for injured Bledisloe squad players."
        }
      ],
      "source": {
        "name": "Planet Rugby"
      }
    },
    "386": {
      "date": "2026-10-15",
      "edition": "Thursday 15 October",
      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Injury update",
          "heading": "Manny Feyi-Waboso on track for England's Australia test despite hamstring tweak",
          "body": "England's game-breaking wing Manny Feyi-Waboso should be fit for the Australia test despite tweaking a hamstring for Exeter against Newcastle on Sunday. Initial scans showed no major damage, and Exeter Chiefs director of rugby Rob Baxter said: \"He's had a scan and there's nothing I'm hearing from our physios saying there should be a long-term issue.\" Feyi-Waboso will miss Exeter's Champions Cup opener at Toulouse on Saturday, with Baxter adding that it becomes a different conversation if he still feels it next Monday."
        },
        {
          "kicker": "Around the world",
          "heading": "Fiji hire Jake White as head coach after Mick Byrne's removal",
          "body": "Wallabies' Nawaqanitawase out of UK Nations Championship Tests. All Blacks call in replacements for injured Bledisloe squad players."
        }
      ],
      "source": {
