          "kicker": "Ranking record",
          "heading": "Italy's best world ranking: No. 8, reached in 2007 and 2024",
          "body": "Italy's highest world ranking is No. 8, a mark the team has reached in two separate years, 2007 and 2024. Their current Nations Championship record is more modest: three played, none won, three lost, with 37 points scored and 131 conceded in those matches. Their next match is a Round 4 meeting with South Africa, the reigning world champions."
        },
        {
