    "391": {
      "date": "2026-10-15",
      "edition": "Thursday 15 October",
      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Team news",
          "heading": "Cardiff's Corniel van Zyl backs Taulupe Faletau to play within weeks",
          "body": "Wales number eight Taulupe Faletau is expected to feature before the Nations Championship resumes in November, with Cardiff head coach Corniel van Zyl saying there are no major concerns over long-term injuries. Faletau was not fielded before last Saturday's Leinster game, the first time since a March shoulder injury, after van Zyl said he felt uncomfortable with his readiness. Asked if he will play in the next couple of weeks, van Zyl said: \"I believe so, 100%.\""
        },
        {
