      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Eligibility",
          "heading": "Mark Nawaqanitawase unavailable for Wallabies' Nations Championship Tests, agent confirms",
          "body": "Mark Nawaqanitawase will not play for the Wallabies in their Nations Championship Tests in the UK, according to his agent, Milan Volavola-Shankar, who says Les Kiss, Wallabies coach, was told in July. The winger, who is also eligible for Fiji and Italy, remains open to all options. \"Mark will not be available for international rugby this year,\" Volavola-Shankar told Code Sports. The absence covers the away matches against England, Scotland and Wales."
        },
        {
          "kicker": "Around the world",
