          "kicker": "Form guide",
          "heading": "Japan win three of last five, with September's Fiji win the latest",
          "body": "In their last five games, Japan have won three and lost two, and the current run stands at three straight wins. The most recent of those was a 20-15 victory away to Fiji in September, part of the Pacific Nations Cup Knockout Stage. Their last defeat came in Round three, a 15-42 loss to France. Both defeats fall before the current winning run began."
        },
